WEBVTT

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:10.730
We are weak.

00:00:10.730 --> 00:00:13.280
There is an overwhelming
difference in fighting ability

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:16.030
between us and the evil gatherers.

00:00:16.030 --> 00:00:18.820
But we must not give up!

00:00:19.690 --> 00:00:23.030
Our goals are not the same as other groups.

00:00:23.030 --> 00:00:26.570
We are here to collect the coins,
negotiate with the alien,

00:00:26.570 --> 00:00:29.820
and put an end to this silly game.

00:00:29.820 --> 00:00:32.030
We need every last ally we can find.

00:00:32.030 --> 00:00:34.360
Hold on.

00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:37.480
Can we really trust her?

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:38.780
What if she's dangerous, she--

00:00:38.780 --> 00:00:40.530
Let me introduce you...

00:00:44.070 --> 00:00:46.150
...to our new member.

00:02:17.530 --> 00:02:19.980
"A few days earlier"

00:02:21.230 --> 00:02:23.440
Who the hell are you?

00:02:23.440 --> 00:02:27.110
How did you get my phone number?

00:02:27.110 --> 00:02:31.690
You were being blackmailed
by a monster named Sudo, weren't you?

00:02:37.190 --> 00:02:39.610
Are you one of his friends?

00:02:39.610 --> 00:02:42.150
No.

00:02:42.150 --> 00:02:44.730
I'm on your side.

00:02:44.730 --> 00:02:47.480
Hang on, I've got something I think you'll like.

00:02:47.480 --> 00:02:49.320
I'm going to hang up for a second.

00:03:01.110 --> 00:03:03.400
What do you want?

00:03:03.400 --> 00:03:07.900
Well... If possible,
I'd like to join your group.

00:03:10.360 --> 00:03:12.730
Okay. Got it.

00:03:14.320 --> 00:03:15.690
How did it go?

00:03:19.030 --> 00:03:21.280
We're going to join these guys?

00:03:21.280 --> 00:03:23.070
Right.

00:03:23.070 --> 00:03:26.860
I don't know what their goal
is in gathering the coins.

00:03:26.860 --> 00:03:28.820
But I want information.

00:03:28.820 --> 00:03:30.480
Did you tell them about Sanbe?

00:03:30.480 --> 00:03:31.440
No.

00:03:31.440 --> 00:03:32.650
Why?

00:03:32.650 --> 00:03:34.730
I asked him directly.

00:03:34.730 --> 00:03:39.440
I vowed to help you two
after I witnessed your strength.

00:03:39.440 --> 00:03:43.530
I will lay my life on
the line for you and Shuichi,

00:03:43.530 --> 00:03:48.230
but I have no reason to help some random group.

00:03:48.230 --> 00:03:53.230
That's great, huh?
He seems to like you quite a bit.

00:03:53.230 --> 00:03:55.860
It suits me fine.

00:03:55.860 --> 00:03:59.820
Anyhow, right now I just want some
pieces to move around the board.

00:03:59.820 --> 00:04:03.570
And that's what I need them for.

00:04:03.570 --> 00:04:08.530
Clair, do you think your sister is there?
Up in the mountains?

00:04:08.530 --> 00:04:10.440
Yes, I do.

00:04:10.440 --> 00:04:14.150
And I think she has allies, too.

00:04:15.150 --> 00:04:18.570
She was speaking with someone on the phone.

00:04:18.570 --> 00:04:25.610
Your sister said she was the one
that turned me into a monster.

00:04:25.610 --> 00:04:30.480
She also said that she was supposed
to be the one inside me.

00:04:30.480 --> 00:04:36.730
What did she mean by that?
What is she trying to do?

00:04:36.730 --> 00:04:43.440
Do you really think you and I
met by coincidence?

00:04:43.440 --> 00:04:47.150
It's not a coincidence. Remember what I said?

00:04:52.360 --> 00:04:56.190
"We were brought together by destiny."

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:02.440
Thank you for coming.

00:05:02.440 --> 00:05:06.110
All right then, mind going
back to your normal form?

00:05:06.110 --> 00:05:07.860
Uhh!

00:05:07.860 --> 00:05:11.400
What are you talking about?
You never mentioned this.

00:05:11.400 --> 00:05:17.980
Everyone that joins our group
must enter into a special pact.

00:05:17.980 --> 00:05:20.820
A special pact?

00:05:20.820 --> 00:05:27.360
To complete it, we'll need you
to return to your normal form, for now.

00:05:27.360 --> 00:05:32.030
If you don't want to, that's fine.
But you can't join us.

00:05:34.940 --> 00:05:38.320
Let me think about it.

00:05:42.360 --> 00:05:43.610
What'll we do, Clair?

00:05:43.610 --> 00:05:45.610
Hold on, Shuichi.

00:05:45.610 --> 00:05:46.530
But--

00:05:46.530 --> 00:05:48.940
I told you!

00:05:48.940 --> 00:05:51.230
What the hell is she doing?

00:05:52.730 --> 00:05:56.070
Okay. I will enter the pact.

00:05:57.980 --> 00:06:01.030
But I am the only one who will do so.

00:06:01.860 --> 00:06:03.610
The only one?

00:06:03.610 --> 00:06:08.570
Unlike all of you,
I don't have a secret to hide.

00:06:08.570 --> 00:06:11.360
And my normal life isn't at
risk of being destroyed at this point.

00:06:13.280 --> 00:06:14.780
Someone's coming out!

00:06:14.780 --> 00:06:16.780
What the...?

00:06:16.780 --> 00:06:20.030
By the way, I'm a normal human.

00:06:20.030 --> 00:06:22.860
The gatherer is this costume.

00:06:22.860 --> 00:06:26.650
They change into a costume
and put someone inside?

00:06:26.650 --> 00:06:29.610
How strange, I've never
seen one like that before.

00:06:29.610 --> 00:06:32.610
For now, I will enter your "pact."

00:06:32.610 --> 00:06:37.190
If you are trustworthy, I will have
this boy enter the pact, too.

00:06:37.190 --> 00:06:41.480
Can a normal human enter the pact, too?

00:06:41.480 --> 00:06:44.320
That's fine. Follow me.

00:06:45.400 --> 00:06:47.570
Clair! It's okay, I'll go too--

00:06:47.570 --> 00:06:51.650
Sorry. Just leave it to me. Please.

00:06:56.280 --> 00:07:01.650
Some people stay the same
when they transform, huh? I didn't know.

00:07:01.650 --> 00:07:03.480
Why do you think so?

00:07:03.480 --> 00:07:07.610
Because you're wearing a mask. Others were too.

00:07:07.610 --> 00:07:11.110
One had a helmet. Another was wearing a sheet.

00:07:11.110 --> 00:07:12.900
It's to hide their faces, right?

00:07:12.900 --> 00:07:17.110
One wasn't hiding his face though.

00:07:17.110 --> 00:07:21.860
That's right. He looked that
way after transforming, huh?

00:07:21.860 --> 00:07:24.940
I bet he's just some ugly guy that
transforms into someone handsome.

00:07:30.110 --> 00:07:31.530
Oh...

00:07:31.530 --> 00:07:34.900
Can... Can I pet you?

00:07:36.190 --> 00:07:38.190
Huh?

00:07:38.190 --> 00:07:42.360
So... How does this pact work?

00:07:42.360 --> 00:07:45.360
We make you vow to protect our secret.

00:07:45.360 --> 00:07:47.940
I already heard that.

00:07:47.940 --> 00:07:50.190
What exactly am I supposed to do...?

00:07:51.230 --> 00:07:58.150
What exactly? Well... To put it simply...

00:07:59.440 --> 00:08:03.030
I have the power to make people keep secrets.

00:08:12.030 --> 00:08:14.230
Yoshioka! Stay away from him!

00:08:14.230 --> 00:08:16.320
What are you freaking out about?

00:08:16.320 --> 00:08:19.730
I'm sure it's fine, he looks pretty silly.

00:08:19.730 --> 00:08:21.820
Plus you're the one that brought them here!

00:08:25.400 --> 00:08:26.320
Go ahead.

00:08:26.320 --> 00:08:27.940
Yay!

00:08:31.110 --> 00:08:33.610
How cute! It's so soft...

00:08:33.610 --> 00:08:37.860
What is she doing? How am I supposed to react?

00:08:39.150 --> 00:08:44.610
Just as I thought. You're a very kind person.

00:08:46.940 --> 00:08:53.320
To tell the truth...
I can understand animals' feelings.

00:08:53.320 --> 00:08:57.070
Uh... I'm a human.

00:08:59.980 --> 00:09:04.110
Honestly, I don't trust you.

00:09:04.110 --> 00:09:09.570
What a mean thing to say.
You wanted to join us, after all.

00:09:09.570 --> 00:09:13.320
You told me I was going
to enter a pact to keep secrets.

00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:15.030
Also, why did you take off your clothes?

00:09:15.030 --> 00:09:16.650
Don't worry about it.

00:09:16.650 --> 00:09:19.610
An outsider was able to force their way in--

00:09:19.610 --> 00:09:22.360
Can you say for sure
that your secret is still safe?

00:09:22.360 --> 00:09:27.940
If I was one of those evil gatherers,
you'd all be dead already.

00:09:27.940 --> 00:09:31.150
You aren't actually an
acquaintance of Ikeuchi's, are you?

00:09:31.150 --> 00:09:34.530
What did you do to him?
Did you blackmail him?

00:09:34.530 --> 00:09:37.650
Did you blackmail him into bringing you here?

00:09:37.650 --> 00:09:39.320
That's my secret.

00:09:39.320 --> 00:09:46.480
But you don't know how many of us
there are or what kind of powers we have.

00:09:46.480 --> 00:09:51.690
Do you want to start a fight
with a group you know so little about?

00:09:51.690 --> 00:09:56.030
What if Ikeuchi told me
what powers you all have?

00:09:56.030 --> 00:10:00.530
That's not possible.
I know, because he's still alive.

00:10:01.360 --> 00:10:05.860
You mean he'll die if he reveals your secrets?

00:10:05.860 --> 00:10:10.280
I hate people that don't keep secrets.

00:10:13.280 --> 00:10:16.860
Anyway, you're the one who's hard to trust.

00:10:16.860 --> 00:10:20.570
You're not a gatherer--
why are you collecting coins?

00:10:20.570 --> 00:10:24.820
How does getting close
to us fit in to your plot?

00:10:24.820 --> 00:10:28.730
Well, fine, it's not like
it's something to hide.

00:10:28.730 --> 00:10:30.480
Do you mind if I go get my phone?

00:10:30.480 --> 00:10:31.900
Go ahead.

00:10:31.900 --> 00:10:33.360
--You're so cute cute cute cute cute...

00:10:33.360 --> 00:10:35.650
--Uh... Could you...?
--You're so cute cute cute cute cute...

00:10:35.650 --> 00:10:38.650
...cute cute cute cute cute cute cute--

00:10:39.730 --> 00:10:42.150
Clair! Did you finish the pact?

00:10:42.150 --> 00:10:45.530
Not yet. Could you give me my phone?

00:10:45.530 --> 00:10:48.150
Oh... Okay.

00:10:48.150 --> 00:10:49.780
Thanks.

00:10:56.610 --> 00:11:01.070
We're looking for her.
She's a monster, like you guys.

00:11:01.070 --> 00:11:06.320
She killed my parents and
turned the boy with me into a monster.

00:11:06.320 --> 00:11:07.730
I'm going to find her, and--

00:11:07.730 --> 00:11:10.360
This is Elena Aoki, isn't it?

00:11:10.360 --> 00:11:13.440
You know my sister?!

00:11:13.440 --> 00:11:17.690
I see. You're Elena's younger sister.

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:19.320
I guess there is some resemblance.

00:11:19.320 --> 00:11:22.570
You've got to tell me!
Is she in these mountains?

00:11:22.570 --> 00:11:24.030
Why is she--

00:11:24.030 --> 00:11:28.190
Well, then... I can tell you.

00:11:28.190 --> 00:11:32.480
You're very clever.
And you're not shaken easily.

00:11:32.480 --> 00:11:35.610
Not to mention being beautiful...

00:11:35.610 --> 00:11:38.860
If you join us, I will tell you.

00:11:40.320 --> 00:11:42.150
Okay.

00:11:44.320 --> 00:11:46.570
All right, I will begin the ceremony.

00:11:46.570 --> 00:11:48.280
Please lie down.

00:11:49.610 --> 00:11:53.400
You don't really look any different
from a normal human.

00:11:54.980 --> 00:11:57.900
And with your power to make people keep secrets,

00:11:57.900 --> 00:12:01.940
you're unlike any monster I've faced before.

00:12:01.940 --> 00:12:06.190
Not everyone has some kind of complex
in regards to their appearance.

00:12:06.190 --> 00:12:10.610
Suffering from the spirit,
from relationships, is much more common.

00:12:14.730 --> 00:12:16.780
I was in love with someone.

00:12:18.900 --> 00:12:21.730
They were a teacher.

00:12:21.730 --> 00:12:24.650
That person had had a strong moral compass--

00:12:24.650 --> 00:12:26.860
they were troubled by our relationship

00:12:26.860 --> 00:12:29.480
and eventually withdrew from me.

00:12:31.190 --> 00:12:35.530
I was a fool--I talked
to my best friend about it,

00:12:35.530 --> 00:12:38.940
thinking I could trust her to keep our secret.

00:12:49.030 --> 00:12:53.280
I hate people that can't keep secrets.

00:12:55.030 --> 00:12:57.940
Can I ask you a question?

00:12:59.110 --> 00:13:03.820
Was that teacher a man? Or a woman?

00:13:04.940 --> 00:13:06.860
She was a woman.

00:13:16.320 --> 00:13:18.190
Wow, that's cool!

00:13:18.190 --> 00:13:22.030
So with your nose, you can
pick up any scent? Like a dog?

00:13:22.030 --> 00:13:22.940
Yeah.

00:13:22.940 --> 00:13:25.690
Animals sure are incredible!

00:13:25.690 --> 00:13:28.400
Like I said, I'm a human.

00:13:30.030 --> 00:13:33.440
It's been a while since they went back there.

00:13:33.440 --> 00:13:37.230
What exactly do you do for this pact?

00:13:37.230 --> 00:13:43.190
I'm sorry, I can't say. That would
be giving away my friend's secret.

00:13:43.190 --> 00:13:46.530
I'm happy to answer any questions
you have about me though.

00:13:46.530 --> 00:13:50.860
Talking about yourself
doesn't count as revealing a secret!

00:13:50.860 --> 00:13:56.530
Oh, uh... So, why did you
decide to start gathering coins?

00:13:56.530 --> 00:14:03.730
Hmm... I'm not interested in the amazing
powers that the alien talks about, of course.

00:14:03.730 --> 00:14:10.110
But if that power ends up in the hands
of someone who really wants it,

00:14:10.110 --> 00:14:14.860
I'd be worried about what'd happen
to my school and my family.

00:14:14.860 --> 00:14:19.480
It was scary to think about--
I had to do something about it.

00:14:20.690 --> 00:14:25.820
That's weird, huh? A weak coward like me...

00:14:25.820 --> 00:14:28.690
She is the same as me.

00:14:28.690 --> 00:14:34.730
She knows how weak she is,
but she can't abandon others.

00:14:34.730 --> 00:14:37.360
She seems to be having a lot of fun.

00:14:41.980 --> 00:14:46.360
So, you said you have a
really good sense of smell, right?

00:14:46.360 --> 00:14:49.650
Can it help you find things you lost?

00:14:49.650 --> 00:14:52.190
I think so, if I know what it smells like.

00:14:52.190 --> 00:14:57.230
I actually kind of lost
my wallet in the mountains here...

00:14:57.230 --> 00:14:59.360
Did it have your ID in it or anything?

00:14:59.360 --> 00:15:04.610
Yeah, it did. So if a bad person finds it...

00:15:12.440 --> 00:15:14.980
Hey, are you okay?

00:15:14.980 --> 00:15:20.230
Sorry, I don't have much stamina
even when I transform.

00:15:20.230 --> 00:15:23.480
Huh? Are you transformed right now?

00:15:23.480 --> 00:15:26.570
You don't seem any different
from a normal person...

00:15:26.570 --> 00:15:30.820
I'm a little different. Don't laugh, okay?

00:15:35.690 --> 00:15:37.730
Ooh! Weirdo!

00:15:39.900 --> 00:15:44.480
No, it's not like that!
I just like animals, that's all.

00:15:44.480 --> 00:15:46.650
I want to be a vet when I get older!

00:15:46.650 --> 00:15:50.610
That's why I wanted to
be able to understand them,

00:15:50.610 --> 00:15:54.650
but I never actually wanted to be one myself!

00:15:54.650 --> 00:15:57.860
That alien was just having fun at my expense!

00:15:57.860 --> 00:16:02.110
Okay! But I'm going
to look for your wallet alone.

00:16:02.110 --> 00:16:05.570
That's no good! It's my wallet, after all!

00:16:11.280 --> 00:16:13.110
Watch this.

00:16:20.070 --> 00:16:23.610
I'll be able to find the wallet
more quickly alone.

00:16:25.690 --> 00:16:29.190
I've got to hurry and
find it before someone else does.

00:16:30.230 --> 00:16:35.070
Plus, if you come along,
your scent will throw me off track.

00:16:36.610 --> 00:16:40.360
Well, what if I went inside you?

00:16:40.360 --> 00:16:41.530
What?!

00:16:41.530 --> 00:16:45.650
Well, if I'm inside
my scent won't get out, right?

00:16:45.650 --> 00:16:48.860
And if I'm in there, I won't slow you down.

00:16:48.860 --> 00:16:51.030
No, we can't do that!

00:16:51.030 --> 00:16:55.690
Why not? Will she--
will your girlfriend get mad?

00:16:55.690 --> 00:16:58.360
No! I mean, Clair isn't
my girlfriend or anything!

00:16:58.360 --> 00:17:01.980
But your clothes will get dirty, and, uh--

00:17:01.980 --> 00:17:03.440
Then I'll take them off!

00:17:05.400 --> 00:17:07.610
Wait--

00:17:07.610 --> 00:17:09.280
Stop that!

00:17:09.280 --> 00:17:11.110
Please let me in!

00:17:12.150 --> 00:17:14.570
Yoshioka...

00:17:14.570 --> 00:17:15.980
Is this where you get in?

00:17:15.980 --> 00:17:18.940
Yeah, but... stop!

00:17:23.320 --> 00:17:24.860
I'm going in.

00:17:24.860 --> 00:17:27.230
Hang on!

00:17:27.230 --> 00:17:31.190
Don't move. This is the best option we have.

00:17:31.190 --> 00:17:33.570
Are you going to leave me behind in the forest?

00:17:35.320 --> 00:17:37.480
Ok, here I go.

00:17:38.110 --> 00:17:40.150
Yoshioka...!

00:17:45.280 --> 00:17:48.030
S-Stop!

00:17:49.980 --> 00:17:52.150
Stop, please!

00:18:06.610 --> 00:18:10.030
So, what do I do?

00:18:10.030 --> 00:18:14.650
Just try moving slowly to start.

00:18:16.110 --> 00:18:17.980
Okay.

00:18:24.780 --> 00:18:29.150
I'm sorry! It doesn't feel like my body.

00:18:29.150 --> 00:18:30.610
Are you hurt?

00:18:30.610 --> 00:18:34.280
No, I'm fine, just calm down.

00:18:34.280 --> 00:18:37.400
I'll move, you can just sit there.

00:18:39.530 --> 00:18:42.860
It's not like it was with Clair.

00:18:42.860 --> 00:18:45.150
It was so easy for her, from the start.

00:18:46.530 --> 00:18:50.150
You're thinking about her now, aren't you?

00:18:51.030 --> 00:18:55.900
Somehow, I can sense your feelings.

00:18:55.900 --> 00:18:58.570
Yeah, when you think of her, it's--

00:18:58.570 --> 00:19:01.280
No! You've got it wrong...

00:19:08.030 --> 00:19:13.230
So... Is this part of the "ceremony"?

00:19:13.230 --> 00:19:19.940
It's not as though I don't like people like you.
Love takes many forms...

00:19:19.940 --> 00:19:25.530
But I don't think we know
each other well enough for this.

00:19:28.480 --> 00:19:30.280
I apologize.

00:19:35.150 --> 00:19:37.110
That was close!

00:19:38.070 --> 00:19:41.780
All right, I'll begin the official ceremony.

00:19:41.780 --> 00:19:44.820
This is a choker woven from my hair.

00:19:44.820 --> 00:19:47.400
I'm going to wrap it around your neck.

00:19:47.400 --> 00:19:52.980
Don't worry. It'll meld with your body,
and nobody will be able to see it.

00:19:52.980 --> 00:19:56.610
However, it will still be there.

00:19:56.610 --> 00:20:00.360
So? How does it protect your secrets?

00:20:00.360 --> 00:20:01.820
It's simple.

00:20:01.820 --> 00:20:05.400
If you reveal our secrets

00:20:05.400 --> 00:20:09.480
or somehow feel yourself
that you've betrayed us,

00:20:09.480 --> 00:20:15.320
the choker will respond to your feelings
and cut your head off.

00:20:15.320 --> 00:20:20.360
Your power is so specific--not like
any of the other monsters I've seen.

00:20:20.360 --> 00:20:24.980
The difference is that I had
a clear vision of what I wanted.

00:20:24.980 --> 00:20:27.730
Those without a clear vision
transform into something

00:20:27.730 --> 00:20:31.940
that can grant their subconscious wishes.

00:20:31.940 --> 00:20:35.150
I actually listened to what the alien said--

00:20:35.150 --> 00:20:40.400
I formed a vision, told him what I wanted,
and this is how I transformed.

00:20:40.400 --> 00:20:45.150
To make those who reveal secrets
pay for what they've done.

00:20:46.820 --> 00:20:52.110
Just to make sure... You do have
information on my sister, right?

00:20:52.110 --> 00:20:54.280
Yeah.

00:20:54.280 --> 00:20:57.280
All right. Go ahead, then.

00:21:07.280 --> 00:21:11.820
I'll put your clothes in the helmet
and hide them, for now.

00:21:11.820 --> 00:21:13.980
If we take them with us,
the scent will get in the way.

00:21:16.610 --> 00:21:17.530
Huh?

00:21:17.530 --> 00:21:22.280
What?! Underwear?!
Are you completely naked in there?!

00:21:22.280 --> 00:21:25.070
B-But you said my clothes would get dirty!

00:21:25.070 --> 00:21:27.110
A-Are you dumb?!

00:21:27.110 --> 00:21:29.940
I'm not dumb! It's just a crazy situation, okay?

00:21:29.940 --> 00:21:32.110
You're the one who feels happy about it!

00:21:32.110 --> 00:21:33.320
I'm not happy!

00:21:33.320 --> 00:21:37.190
Yes, you are! I can sense your feelings!

00:21:43.780 --> 00:21:47.610
Let's stop messing around,
we need to find your wallet.

00:21:47.610 --> 00:21:49.190
Okay.

00:22:05.320 --> 00:22:08.030
What are you doing, Subaru?

00:22:08.030 --> 00:22:11.230
I just found this wallet. Must be my lucky day.

00:23:44.190 --> 00:23:46.980
"Episode 7: Metamorphosis"
